Source: Originally written for the native_comms package by the same author;
        maintained in this repository as native/include/glaze_meta.h.

Note: glaze_meta.h is an independent implementation of a subset of the `glz::`
API using only C++23 standard library facilities. It is not derived from the
glaze library (https://github.com/stephenberry/glaze) and carries no code from
it, so no glaze copyright or license notice applies. The wire format is
BEVE-Lite, inspired by but not identical to glaze's native binary format.